{"id":"vod_md_3847","vodId":"3847","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"高达创战者","name_cn":"高达创战者","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"25集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230831-1/6d4fcfe03548be2b80d15b49ebfe3819.jpg"},"summary":"动画作品「机动战士高达」的塑料模型通称“钢普拉”在1980年代掀起了一阵狂潮。如今，第2次钢普拉热潮，应该称之为新的浪潮席卷整个世界。受它的人气影响，于是有了“ガンプラバトル”。不是虚拟空间里的CG，而是通过操纵制作好的钢普拉来战斗，使用划时代的系统参加世界大赛。故事的主人公入尾成十分钟爱钢普拉，参加钢普拉战斗世界大赛，是这个年轻的钢普拉builder的梦想。作为模型店唯一的一个儿子拥有者超高的钢普拉制作技术的他，却对战斗的操纵十分生疏，以至于在大赛出场的第一战就败北。他遇到了一个叫做雷吉的有着超凡的钢普拉操纵技术的迷般的少年，他们组队像世界大赛发起挑战，目标是参加世界大赛，然后胜利！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-31 08:18:54","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/XmS3kphc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/W0erxxOH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/6mtoa0P1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/A6oDS9wy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/yt47YmZs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/4smrNiqW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/txYMmBdb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/yw34Ajp7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/evAXqAMK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/qXRM5diI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/NZjsLvLR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/qWMaskZh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/zAo87rm1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/94w8tBHk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/s8NT0737/index.m3u8"}